@startuml timing-burst
title Burst: CLK stays high between the transactions, DATA is released and pulled low again
concise "Transaction" as T
binary "CLK" as CLK
robust "Pending slaves" as PS

@0
T is "idle"
CLK is low
PS is "announce"

@10
T is "POLL len 0"
CLK is high
PS is "wait"

@40
T is "REQUEST_DATA 42"

@70
T is "POLL 10100 / 5"

@100
T is "REQUEST_DATA 40"

@130
T is "POLL 0 / 1"

@160
T is "REQUEST_DATA 25"

@190
T is "POLL 00 / 2"

@220
T is "REQUEST_DATA 15"

@250
T is "final STOP"
CLK is low
PS is "announce again"

@260
T is "idle"
@enduml
